    "name": "zeb/world",
    "description": "aslnut, a world engine on WebGPU and WebGL2 (Earth or a flat floor, terrain, imagery, GeoJSON and tiled data, scales, entities), for RWE templates: <World> with the useWorld, useElement and useWorldEvent hooks, and aslnut's whole API (earth, plane, imagery, terrain, layer, data, scale, theme, shape, ...). Elements are kept in step by id; a restyle is never a rebuild. Offline; the tile worker and lazy chunks sit next to the entry.",
